<div class="return">
<h2>NOTICE FOR CANADIAN CUSTOMERS</h2>
<p>Canada Post is experiencing ongoing labor actions that began in May 2025, including periodic 
                        rotating strikes. As a result, shipments sent via Canada Post may see intermittent delays, and 
                        tracking updates can take longer than usual. You can continue to monitor your parcel’s status as normal. For urgent issues or significantly delayed orders, please contact our support team. For official service updates, please refer to Canada Post’s website.</p>
<h2>NOTICE FOR U.S. CUSTOMERS</h2>
<p>Due to recent shifts in the import/export landscape in the USA, your order may experience 
                        delays during Customs Clearance. Regrettably, this is beyond the control of both us and our shipping 
                        partners. For updates on your order, please contact our customer service team at customersupport@@warrenjames.org. 
                        We appreciate your understanding and patience as we adapt to these ongoing changes.</p>
<h3>TERMS OF SALE</h3>
<p>By placing an order with Warren James, Inc (“Warren James”) , you are (i) offering to purchase a product, (ii) representing that you are of legal age to 
                        form a binding contract, and (iii) representing that all information you provide to us in connection with 
                        such order is true and accurate and you are an authorized user of the payment method provided. The receipt by 
                        you of an order confirmation does not constitute Warren James’s acceptance of an order. We retain the right to 
                        refuse any request made by you.</p>
<p>Prior to Warren James’s acceptance of an order, verification of information may be required. Warren James 
                        reserves the right at any time after receipt of your order to accept or decline your order, or any 
                        portion thereof, even after your receipt of an order confirmation from Warren James, for any reason 
                        whatsoever. Warren James reserves the right to limit the number of items ordered and to refuse service 
                        to you without prior notification. In the event that an item lists an incorrect price, either due to 
                        typographical or other error, Warren James shall have the right to refuse or cancel any such order placed for 
                        the incorrect price, regardless of whether the order is being or has been processed. If payment has already been 
                        made or if your account has already been charged for the purchase and the order is canceled, Warren James shall 
                        credit your account in the amount of the incorrect price.</p>
<p>The risk of loss and title for product(s) purchased by you pass to you upon our delivery of the product(s) to the carrier.</p>
<h2>EXCHANGE / REFUND POLICY</h2>
<h3>ALL SALES ARE FINAL</h3>
<p>By completing your purchase, you acknowledge that all sales are final. Once your order is confirmed, cancellations, refunds, or changes to your order cannot be accommodated.</p>
<h3>NO REFUNDS OR EXCHANGES</h3>
<p>We do not offer refunds, exchanges, or returns for any reason, including but not limited to changes in personal circumstances, order errors, or 
                        dissatisfaction with the product.</p>
<h3>DAMAGED OR DEFECTIVE ITEMS</h3>
<p>In the rare event that your item arrives damaged or defective, please contact us within 14 days of delivery. Merchandise must be unworn, unwashed and in its original condition with all tags attached and packaging intact.We may, at our discretion, offer a replacement or repair, provided the issue is verified and subject to product availability. All refunds will be credited back to the original form of payment. Shipping costs are not refundable. Once your claim has been processed, we will advise what to do 
                        with the damaged or defective item. We will ship you the replacement free of charge.</p>
<h3>ORDER MODIFICATIONS</h3>
<p>Once an order is placed, modifications (e.g., changes to shipping address or payment method) cannot be guaranteed. For preorders, changes to the order may be permitted, only if the preorder is still open. Please contact us immediately if you need to make changes.</p>
<h3>CANCELLATIONS BY THE SELLER</h3>
<p>In the unlikely event that we are unable to fulfill your order, you will be notified promptly and issued a full refund or store credit, depending on your preference.</p>
<h3>ACKNOWLEDGMENT OF POLICY</h3>
<p>By completing your purchase, you agree to and accept the terms of this policy. We recommend reviewing all product details and policies carefully before placing your order.</p>
<p> If you do not see an answer to your question above or if your order has not yet been fulfilled, please contact us customersupport@@warrenjames.org and our team will be in touch.</p>
<h3>EXCESSIVE RETURNS</h3>
<p>Warren James monitors returns to identify potential misuse or abuse of our return policies. We flag customers who meet our criteria for excessive returns. Customers who are flagged may be subject to our review, and revocation of standard customer return policies. We reserve the right to refuse service to anyone.</p>
<h3>DISCLAIMERS</h3>
<p>All features, specifications, products, prices of products and services, discounts, promotions and offers described on our Services 
                        are subject to change at any time, and we reserve the right to make changes to them without notice to you. We reserve 
                        the right, without prior notice, to limit the order quantity on any product and/or refuse service to any customer. We 
                        have made every effort to display as accurately as possible the colors of our products that appear on the Web site; 
                        however, the actual color you will see will depend on many factors, including your computer, and we cannot guarantee 
                        that your computer will accurately display our colors. Products are available while supplies last. All prices and 
                        products advertised are subject to change. All prices displayed on the Services are quoted in U.S. dollars.</p>
<p>ACCORDINGLY, WARREN JAMES MAKES NO REPRESENTATION OR WARRANTY WITH RESPECT TO ANY PRODUCT SOLD, EXCEPT AS MAY EXPRESSLY BE STATED HEREIN.</p>
<hr/>
<p><small>Revision v1.2.15<small></small></small></p>
